{
  "$sources": [
    "SAEngine practice on the HL-93 basis, for a code pack that gives no traffic loads (BNBC 2020 covers buildings only; the RHD bridge loading is not entered): the HL-93 design truck, tandem and lane load, multiple presence and IM 33 % as in AASHTO LRFD Art. 3.6.1-3.6.2"
  ],
  "source": "SAEngine practice (HL-93 basis): design truck or tandem with the lane load, multiple presence factors, dynamic allowance 33 % on the vehicles",
